  "basis": "Exact-QID map outline supplies25.622m by16.201m envelope. The mapped road/tram/walk runs are about23.5m with skew approximately-0.138m per transverse meter; member/vertical dimensions remain photo/map approximations. Current PMTiles bridge road35185614704570,tram35184526581440 and sidewalk35184526386510 establish horizontal fit. Anchor[30.28123615,59.91672875],heading-0.08154873428: +X east/southeast,-X west/northwest,+Z south/southwest toward Fontanka mouth,-Z north/northeast along Griboyedov Canal. Standard-viewer water-relative origin10.862507820129167m is a coarse native water plane,not surveyed sea level. Ordinary overview and near-detail pictures establish green scalloped girders,granite drum ends,four obelisk lamps and circle/scroll railings.",
  "fit": "All five loaded tiers preserve76 building records,the independent road inputs,the original246 raw transportation records,rawDEM,ground mesh and water. Crossing replacement reduces246to244 nonempty rendered road records; short boundary fragments of walk/tram lines can remain outside the exact outline. Eight roadway/tram-width samples at the bridge ends are within0.014176m of the authored end datum across every tier. Skew means some probes lie over the visible model and some over adjoining paving. Independent neighboring bridge inputs retain their records and receive no authored joins. Coarse PMTiles water fragments have visible height steps around the canal mouth; shoreline heights,generic surrounding buildings and generated road/rail support terraces remain approximations. Exact canal embankments,the larger adjacent bridge and the surrounding street/catenary system are outside this asset. Failed loading preserves all246 roads and native ground/water; unloading releases model/support geometry and restores inputs.",
